  (text "I2C address 0x48. Start at 128 samples/s; target 10 readings/s per channel.\nThe programmable gain setting does not remove the ADC's physical input-voltage limits.\nDedicated isolated two-wire NTC probes. No shared charger bias.\nStill to verify: probe resistance/temperature curve, cable protection, broken/shorted probes and settling time.\nAIN2/AIN3 connect to protected-divider isolation on f06a."
